* ============================================================
* DC sweep of a diode clipper (Xyce Users' Guide 1.4 example)
* Sweeps VIN from -10 V to 15 V in 1 V steps: 26 operating points.
* Exercises: non-linear device + continuation chain + streamed CSV.
* ============================================================

.MODEL DMOD D (IS=1e-14 N=1.2 RS=0.5 CJO=0 VJ=0.7 BV=20)

VIN in 0 DC 0
R1  in out 1k
D1  out 0 DMOD

.DC VIN -10 15 1

.OPTIONS MAXITERS=250 RETRY=4

.END